---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../config/site';

const { email, analyticsId } = SITE;
---

<Legal
  title="Cookie policy"
  description="Which cookies and similar technologies the All Set Consulting website uses, and how to change your choice."
  intro="The site works without any tracking. Analytics cookies are only ever set if you say yes."
>
  <h2>What cookies are</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small files a website stores in your browser. Similar technologies, such as your
    browser’s local storage, work in much the same way. This policy covers both.
  </p>

  <h2>What we use</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Name</th><th>Type and purpose</th><th>Kept for</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>allset-consent</code></td>
        <td>
          <strong>Strictly necessary.</strong> Local storage entry that remembers whether you
          accepted or declined analytics cookies, so we don’t ask on every page.
        </td>
        <td>12 months</td>
      </tr>
      {
        analyticsId && (
          <>
            <tr>
              <td><code>_ga</code></td>
              <td>
                <strong>Analytics, only with consent.</strong> Google Analytics cookie that tells
                visits apart, so we can count visitors and see which pages are useful.
              </td>
              <td>2 years</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>_ga_*</code></td>
              <td>
                <strong>Analytics, only with consent.</strong> Google Analytics cookie that keeps
                track of the current session.
              </td>
              <td>2 years</td>
            </tr>
          </>
        )
      }
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {
    !analyticsId && (
      <p>
        We don’t currently use any analytics or advertising cookies. If we add analytics, they will
        only be set after you accept them, and we’ll list them here.
      </p>
    )
  }
  <p>
    We don’t use advertising cookies, and our fonts are hosted on our own site rather than loaded
    from a third party.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choice</h2>
  <p>
    When you first visit, we ask whether you accept analytics cookies. Declining has no effect on
    how the site works. You can change your mind at any time:
  </p>
  <p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-cookie-settings>
      Change cookie settings
    </button>
  </p>
  <p>
    You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings. We ask again after 12 months, or
    if this policy changes in a way that affects your choice.
  </p>

  <h2>More information</h2>
  <p>
    For how we handle personal information more broadly, see our
    <a href={url('/privacy/')}>privacy policy</a>. Questions are welcome at
    <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
